        "raw": "<p>So the end of April saw my son&#39;s 16th birthday. I made arrangements and was able to order him the core SotM set. Standard shipping, FedEx. Package was picked up Saturday 30th. Expected delivery to be Friday 5th.</p><p>On Tuesday FedEx transferred the package to USPS in Dallas. On Friday, I checked tracking and there was a delivery exception posted and it was undeliverable for some reason. This was early in the morning, like before deliveries are even made. My son received notice that there was a package for him at the post office. The implication being that where they live the carriers don&#39;t deliver packages. So, my son&#39;s mother made arrangements to run to the post office on Saturday.</p><p>The f&#39;n post office is closed on Saturdays...</p><p>I am so not impressed.</p>",
