        "created_at": "2016-06-06T19:14:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That is almost certainly what happened. (Source : I’m a fedex driver).</p>\n<p>Some places, if they are odd or very sparse, get shuffled off to the postal service even if it wasn’t Smart post, because Fed ex doesn’t have a driver for that area. Also, the country drivers get lazy, because they have to cover 200+miles a day, and some sections get … lost… :?</p>",
